index 54794b6..16ee7c9 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG_UWX.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG_UWX.md
@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.2-rc21 — Invite safety, clearer invites, more themes
+
+- **No more accidental spam.** Turning on automatic friend or group invites now asks first and tells you exactly who it would hit right away, how many, which message, and how often. "All online friends" gets a red warning. "Invite now" for 3+ people, "Invite N to group", invite setups with the send button, and Event Mode presets that switch invites on all ask first too.
+- **A pop-up for every invite** (friend and group), plus one live counter per batch ("Friend invites: 3 of 10 sent") with a **Stop** button. You can turn the per-invite pop-ups off on the Invites tab.
+- **Stop all invites**: one red button (Command and Invites) turns both automatic invites off and stops anything sending mid-batch.
+- **Safety cap**: automatic friend invites send at most 8 per pass (every 15 seconds), never a whole friends list at once.
+- **Clearer invite cards**: "Group invites — ask people in this lobby to join your group" vs "Friend invites — ask friends to come to you", a big AUTO ON / AUTO OFF switch, and a plain-English line saying what's happening right now (e.g. "On — inviting favorite friends (5 online) to you, each at most once per 30 min. Next: Vex and Kai.").
+- **6 new client themes**: Ember, Abyss, Synthwave, Toxic, Cobalt, Bone.
+- **5 new chatbox themes**: Terminal, Cinema, Retro, Soft, Glitch — all with "Now showing" layouts.
+
 ## 0.6.1-rc20 — Now showing, your crew, photos to the showcase
 
 - **Now showing** (OSC Lab → new chatbox module): what the world's video player is playing, e.g. "🍿 Now showing: Static Hearts". Tokens for title, who queued it (off by default), time, length, time left and a progress bar. Read from VRChat's log — links are never put in the chatbox, only a title (or "a YouTube video" if VRCX has no YouTube API key). Hides itself when you leave the instance. Every chatbox theme has a matching layout.
